{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4P27KSBx_fDd_33tOUmMYg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.673781+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4P27KSBx_fDd_33tOUmMYg","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/IyyL8LNAXnkgcdHwn7xxBDt6HT3ZJpd18JkEiafUs17sC8uOULopEP5Q1bw91m4nUGE8Idf4fJAuAh0SxbzbH2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span>暨南大学产业经济研究院2027年数字经济专业硕士（MDE）项目正式启动推免生招生工作！本项目依托产业经济学国家重点学科优势资源，融合“学术导师+行业导师”双指导模式，致力于培养掌握坚实数字经济理论、精通数字技术应用、具备产业视野的复合型人才。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span>欢迎全国各高校获得推免资格的优秀应届本科毕业生踊跃报名！</span></span></span></strong></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><b><span>学院简介</span></b></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLSicsR1iaicib6mJDKJYTTTIgg3SzDH0PPbnayHxRosAWMWJnvr7beQ4UFXZLnkkGfY8LW4TBvkKNekHHHBYQ9ntKR7QB2FdYGL2WU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>产业经济研究院是暨南大学</span></span><span><strong><span><span>国家重点学科—产业经济学</span></span></strong></span><span><span>的所在单位，秉持</span></span><span><strong><span><span>“理论顶天、实践立地”</span></span></strong></span><span><span>的学术传统，坚持</span></span><strong><span><span><span>“学科交叉研究、产业精英培养、新型智库建设</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></strong><span><span>三位一体，致力成为全国产业经济和数字经济领域顶尖科研单位、人才基地和卓越智库。</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>项目简介</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLTjxsLgicm7OOGmYKekXaPf37yJicPyaCvicuXaKJGITWfs6szB40CN49g0XDw6OS4PdictrAmibuPO0aEJVPptLvD3U2yD241BSLDk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>数字经济硕士（Master of Digital Economy，简称“MDE”）项目依托产业经济学国家重点学科及多个省市重点研究平台，致力于打造</span></span><span><strong><span><span>全国第一个扎根湾区产业的数字经济硕士项目</span></span></strong></span><span><span>。项目结合人工智能与数字技术应用，以数字经济理论创新为依托，聚焦探索数字技术与实体经济融合发展。通过产教融合的课程设置和雄厚的师资配备，培养一批具备数字经济思维、掌握数字经济发展规律的复合型数字经济人才，为大湾区的经济发展和产业转型贡献力量。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科底蕴深厚，深耕产业数十载</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>产经院前身为1994年成立的暨南大学工业经济研究所，学科渊源可追溯至1963年经济学家黄德鸿教授领衔建立的工业经济专业。1981年获全国首批经济学硕士学位授予权，1986年获博士学位授予权，为华南地区最早的经济学博士点。2002年，产业经济学学科被批准为国家重点建设学科。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2025年软科“中国大学专业排名”经济学科（包含产业经济学）评级为</span><span>A</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><strong><span><span>广东省排名第2位</span></span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院立足粤港澳大湾区，承担了大量国家级、省部级及地方政府委托课题，研究足迹遍布粤港澳大湾区各核心城市。学院师生深入产业一线，持续跟踪研究湾区产业转型升级的前沿动态，为国家及粤港澳大湾区经济发展提供了重要的智力支持。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLRrH9kiatM6BESXMzTALLFHJqmEQU2seTrcaCbCxoeXXbxcN49QZjwvEZqCLsHPJqe94KMZx1QnxfAeJ3EoHIzhCB52qPcQE9oA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>扎根产业办专业，推动产教深融合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院秉承</span></span><span><strong><span><span>“顶天立地”</span></span></strong></span><span><span>的学术传统，</span></span><span><strong><span><span>“扎根产业办专业”</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，持续推动产教深度融合，通过“走出去”与“引进来”相结合的方式，打造全方位产业实践平台。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>走出去——数字经济深调研、广东省民营企业“千企调研”项目、与行业协会达成战略合作。</span></span></span></strong><span><span>学院自主开发</span></span><span><strong><span><span>“产业链+RSCP”产业分析范式</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，持续组织研究生走进企业一线，深入调研大湾区前沿行业动态。目前已在新一代人工智能、智能网联、新能源汽车、智能装备、集成电路、生物医药、氢能等国家重点战略产业，累计完成高质量行业研究报告50余份，让学生直面产业真问题，将课堂所学应用于企业实践，真正做到学以致用。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>点击图片链接了解更多</span></span><span>👉</span></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4463504356541399044#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLS8UfXN8xkjzTk0Uf7GDB8ZEd8XSlJlQY3gpgz7TXiaABO6PoXPMtGkMd13nzJgtOoFiaZnVWOupic0JVMLtLic52XDYY7cBk3IIgw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><span><span>数字经济深调研系列活动</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247526860&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=250646170c1cb992907ccf31e8ffb0e0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLQ0Ogm40abQ4ibjtdQBtI0efFXiaia6T9LRAkcFwE7V5BOEX1RMzZeB8UCKBEJL2YLHiajfsmrsjwhqTBYjkHNTj3X1O7x1egwPRIc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><span><span>“千企调研”项目</span></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247521926&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b630230c2f337491feab8b3b90603055&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLS6aJhG7fcQst5tTysVZBbmPL8dYKPKibv2Dw062k1YribibpBZctIicTMXUUgsCtCCcRDiaEzXvNKdk0sS7HQ9OricxQrIvQGuPVia8c/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247513162&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=350a696309be7d67ff10ec65e9f3936a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLTKECqOhl2M301LoSTGFLuEExKmmhamed7sqkae2fvL6lSpOwTVicINh4G23J3J99IEFkTiaLEiaLqia79RDcP41piaepumtSR1E35E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247513211&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7480bd5c2efad40098a55a9db13e9e69&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLSeTlIVH8o9Uc3MHO6ONpUnSUm7VSPnynt6YkuYZp52VMyRwSBOI8ttJBWltrsAucGcZvmNH3c3AfM1jHGOZcR9jmqIKVJhpyo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247513329&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=65de49743af6687e58b8ace92df834b6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLRqYZamsJicapUOKS453hsNWvtNNTAuKl00aJcea4P3Ush8FguvSQEibpGQmH5Rqe9GFsZrtcswNBDX5O5wBBNfPNJbWRglgvkvI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><strong><span><span>与行业协会达成战略合作</span></span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>引进来——学术导师+行业导师“1+1”双导师制度。</span></span></strong></span><span><span> 学院聘请40余位来自腾讯、美的、三七互娱等头部企业的行业导师，与院内学术导师共同组成“学术导师+行业导师”双指导团队。学术导师负责夯实理论基础、指导学术研究，行业导师带来一线实战经验与产业前沿洞察，双方优势互补，为学生提供理论学习与产业实践的双重支撑。</span></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247523023&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=cba27a32f9ddb225f90de7f4d950d0f2&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLQVoDiaOibiaR26a8TY521H8FibUYYULue1AdxRD0uIUF34uRx5ibvvsVPGEVGhrB4icAib7yRvoygWe3Bt2reMw5BFhCdUtJGMmyy98U/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247522451&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=eb3bae4e0ce14c49dd72b8ba2296ee49&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLQZDcUmBhO5SI5AlaBYBYqbuxA3YYjJ8hZwFwCAE3D9wftDgnO94o675icaLrbkic1I2UiaF4icHNNwVibPIKBiaTHAJ4ZBzXrngNcmg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247520658&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8431019590ff4bb098fb1e25450ac92d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLQmRX8P7gVf9W3ia3gAB9ChpasmjAI7iaZpX1DhicXKkp0DibLqns76iafHa6h5g6QcVXgAkZiaCpeOwN2QzgBaj6LicJ5KicrB9rDt7aE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><span><span>与行业导师面对面</span></span></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>课程改革迭代，三三体系创一流</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院持续推动课程体系改革，构建了独具特色的</span></span><span><strong><span><span>“三三制”</span></span></strong></span><span><span>课程体系，涵盖</span></span><strong><span><span><span>产业经济、创新管理、数智技术</span></span></span></strong><span><span>三大模块，兼顾理论基础、管理能力与数字技能，全面培养学生的综合素养。学院以“平台思维”破局，打破学科学院学校壁垒来聘请师资力量，进而组建起由一批优秀青年科学家组成的顶尖AI师资团队。通过AI青年科学家与产业经济专家共同讨论，设计出人工智能与数字科技的前沿技术课程体系，进而摒弃传统商科“重经管轻技术”的局限，推动科技创新与商科教育的跨界融合大创新。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4463510216722284546#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLSPicmLlsOibTvOzRQsKLdEjBUgK2MHCT1l60y4WkTkGP5I1lC5gmramaiaAujz8npkAQJFlWuXWjJ8LPTlX8Y5HxB7xhT7nSnxvI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><span><span>数字科技与人工智能系列课程</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院引入自主开发的“产业链+RSCP”产业分析范式，培养学生系统化分析产业问题的能力。同时积极搭建实践成果展示平台，定期举办课程汇演活动，并组织学生参与全国高校数字经济实践成果大赛。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247521823&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=3c55479ce7b824a5b618c5c2ef965b79&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLSkDMxwrO0DZkfpWtMLG0WmicOvKhbD5PZuiaIsOFzFGwtQkddQBxshIicslNalwqXVvoUqDUNibELvfhDo0XMJnanF2ItwTRwHXAI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><span><span>产业分析报告汇演比赛</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247522683&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6f118e4805b59a7bc8341e91f5f6a245&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLS7o8JeH3rkVIfl5iclvpCic0EnzeDuedYYeXGVM90WKAMFNVfmRfFECdUGeFhbEt9h59C9tBjmXwkpibRf2XXic9xeT5Udgk4MF7g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></a></section><p><span><span>全国高校首届数字经济实践成果大赛</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><b><span>招生指标</span></b></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>产业经济研究院（招生代码：002），数字经济（全日制）指标：</span><span><span>20</span></span><span>个，</span><span>拟招收推免生名额</span><span><span>≤20</span></span><span>个。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLTrYP5VotibxL5kpBDKBxWqkxhqwkFiaXgDgEBBichCNyMvKQ7OtY3C4HyaSb1GZuvER7xicplwX4Jqiaa9Yib4jY2kcsQKZp3XQSEYA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>报名申请</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>一、报名申请对象</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>大陆地区高校优秀本科应届推免生。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>二、报名申请条件与要求</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（一）获得本科学校推荐免试资格，材料齐全，手续完备；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）身心健康，综合素质强；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）具备较好的科研素养与学术潜质，有突出科研表现者优先考虑；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）本科毕业专业与申请研究生专业原则上应同属一个一级学科。若跨一级学科，则需提供以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.书面申请，说明跨专业理由，并提供相关支撑材料，如参加过研究生申请专业的科研项目或取得相关科研成果、选修过相关主干课程（含双学位）等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科毕业专业与研究生申请专业各有一名教授的书面推荐信；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学院可根据实际情况，决定是否进行科目加试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）原则上每位推免生只在一个专业参加一次复试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（六）招收直博生条件与要求详见产业经济研究院的网站公告。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>三、报名申请程序</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）报名时间：2026年8月21日—9月14日</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，登录暨南大学研究生招生信息网—&gt;推免生报名系统，填写并提交个人申请信息表。报名信息确认提交后，不可修改或撤销。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><strong><span><span><span>二）审核：9月8日—9月15日</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，学校将审核并回复考生是否已获得复试资格，考生可在暨南大学研究生招生信息网推免生报名系统中查询审核结果。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>（三）复试时间：9月17日—19日</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，各专业具体复试要求及日程安排9月10日后详见暨南大学研究生招生信息网。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>（四）若教育部推免工作进度安排有调整，相应的报名、审核及复试时间将另行通知。请考生密切关注我校研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>五、报名须提交材料</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>相关材料扫描电子版在报名系统中提交，清单如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）《暨南大学2027年接收优秀推荐免试攻读硕士研究生申请表》，报名系统填报信息后生成申请表，须申请人签名；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）在校历年学习成绩表，加盖推荐学校教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）国家英语四级或六级考试成绩；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）本人学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）证明学生本人在科研方面有突出表现的学术论文等原创性成果材料（该材料不作为必须提供材料，供复试专家组参考）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>六、关于拟录取</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学校对通过复试并拟录取为我校硕士研究生的推免生发放同意接收函，推免生须按规定时间在中国研究生招生信息网</span></span><span><span>（http://yz.chsi.com.cn/）的推免服务系统完成网上报名确认手续，未在规定时间内完成网上报名确认手续者视为自动放弃，不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>七、材料相关</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span><span>如申请人提供的材料不真实，一经发现则随时取消录取资格，并予以通报。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>八、咨询电话</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（一）产业经济研究院数字经济专硕咨询电话：020-85221297、020-85221001</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>oiie@jnu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）暨南大学研招办咨询电话：020-85220045、020-85228526、020-85223932。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>九、温馨提示</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1．在2026年9月17日前，若申请人尚未知晓是否获得推免生资格，可先参加我校推免生复试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．若申请人取得当年推免生资格，则复试成绩有效；若未取得推免生资格，则复试成绩无效。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>十、相关招生信息</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>数字经济专硕全日制学制2年，学费2.25万/学年。</span></span></p><p><span><span>更多相关招生信息详见暨南大学研招生信息网首页信息。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>-END-</span></span></p><section><section><p><span><span>编辑 | 罗   婧</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审 | 王晓蕾</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审 | 潘   珊</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审 | 陶   锋</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLTs6cCOncaje6qPicxIiau7KonjxsD9l4crUoSz1UTKCr8OI38Ol6p1gOdEj6T5ncC1a1VE1rMrWCp6ohnFT3EeQzF6NpcWicT4XY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=2\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><p><strong><span>数字经济专业硕士项目</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;mid=2247522132&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7ff6b8e70a62f92f37b2e9dc400d1d07&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VINpFibJevLROYLpaWBicK8QJLsSicOV9y13XLOicLYeib3flE2nmGSicvFxlg50ic20XSlH5OJib7RhleRRIpVrQYxhBUia2bo1MUe1WKxfooneib7dc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=5\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4463510216722284546#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLSySd5THwDxsua1gXiblyByV9VnTPlcxPOmib3Tp1PWU7nufRlIiaibtWMAtQfZ2JYyKsdpIXGOgWWpUrucfpTWNqDXWkrdeWv46Kk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=6\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4463504356541399044#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLSUYn937CvwSuxG2IkXqG06GicNsXljTyOwuAwIIYmJ8bkc7ejLuHrpVcJBjZelJqCXtsqhZdrN1VZeibpgRswUsyTmjcKvpn5pw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=7\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4463507847141851138#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLSWqsv5U5CWNOAk7y4054bLW0AZCQLtXXPFZpOgZxackvHSAjxiaDVOLpFpg278ZhGhCRWZQNMJwDvVU3g9ibry3g0TTTzRQlQ9I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=8\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4463515400479375363#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLR7c0wla2LW4icIcWwnJzlU5gNLBYHBvricEiauwk6BXcbSRBmVSOwrBGiaFAgqD5O3HFK84xyg7UjicEXrISQbiaqZ2SQ02ibUNGoa8Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=9\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4NjgwMDM2MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4210131145561882635#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VINpFibJevLSGpMEVnYdA69COU0ticicnnbh3ykVWiaQHJI5UZvoBolsG3EWOWhDu4kvMouEqVGBW46sh5TXfQk733L7UUnq7NzFmHLJuxDxSZQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=10\"/></span></a></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9d4a45f4e52f1ba074e0cc0ac7bad8e16659c3fd41216ce93b061c39ecf4a45a","textLength":2953,"sourceSha256":"bcd0c024186ec8c44f9218fc7e2891b9eaec1e83de4d06e6a14d1b363d13c7e1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9112a28dffb59fd62f36","title":"2026年暨南大学产业经济研究院2027年数字经济专硕推免报名8月21日正式启动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.673781+00:00"}
